{"version":1,"content":"<p>據報道，特斯拉在韓國擴大FSD（監督版完全自動駕駛）功能使用範圍的計劃遇到阻礙，韓國交通監管部門認為其提交的技術資料嚴重不足，目前無法開展安全審查。<strong>最引人關注的是，特斯拉此次提交的核心支持材料只有5頁，其中2頁為技術説明，另外3頁則是荷蘭相關批准文件的封面。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587282.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T11:24:01.969411+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T11:12:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T11:17:17.071320+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T11:17:17.071320+00:00","content_hash":"ed9a3d4d1e849dd38b5555d46ee2b39c190ef96196cd2e6793c72fac9039aee3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}